  "body": "## What\n\nSlice 2 of #5119: `id serve` now builds its live event-sync pull gate from the operator server config's `[policy] pull_policy`, on both accepted and dialled sessions.\n\n- `event_sync::gate(policy)` is the new constructor; `open_gate()` is now `gate(PullPolicy::Open)`.\n- `EventSyncProtocol::with_gate(...)` lets serve hand the configured gate to the accept side as well as the dial side.\n- With no `--server-config`, the policy is the code default (open) — behaviour is unchanged.\n- The local event store is not a world and has no membership source, so a configured `members` policy fails closed: every pull is refused, the startup log says so, and it never silently becomes open ([`NoWorlds`]).\n- Adds a test that a `Members` gate over a no-membership store sends and receives nothing.\n\nThin slice: it lands the pull-policy half of remaining #5119. Still to do before #5119 can close (tracked on the issue and the queue task):\n\n1. persist config-provisioned accounts / preformed group events into live serving state (restart idempotent),\n2. wire `config.freshness()` into a real seitan admission check on the serve path,\n3. integration tests for member/non-member pulls, provisioning/restart, no-world handling, configured freshness,\n4. verify/update the #798 remainder + acceptance-brief handoff line.\n\nCloses nothing on its own; part of #5119.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `cargo check -p id --all-targets` — pass\n- `cargo test -p id event_sync` — running locally (result noted in review)\n\nOpened by the OpenChamber scheduled repo-health lane (queue task 14074, lane `02cafe76-eafd-4d0b-aaa6-2b7a737d68dc`).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796820361&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=8046&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F8046&signature=dc5301d6147c466e2a84c5d33b0e7b7e6356fb166133303cbea1094947f1c9af\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/8046?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
